# Development API keys (only loaded when Seed:UseDevData is true in Development)
@host = http://localhost:5080
@acmeAdmin = sk_acme01_dev-acme-admin-000000000001
@acmeReader = sk_acme02_dev-acme-reader-00000000002
@globexMember = sk_globex1_dev-globex-member-0000003
@initechAdmin = sk_initech1_dev-initech-admin-000004

### Who am I? (tenant, plan, limits)
GET {{host}}/me
X-Api-Key: {{acmeAdmin}}

### Create a project as Acme
POST {{host}}/projects
X-Api-Key: {{acmeAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Acme Website", "description": "Marketing site rebuild" }

### List Acme's projects
GET {{host}}/projects
X-Api-Key: {{acmeAdmin}}

### Try to read Acme's project as Globex (paste the id): 404
GET {{host}}/projects/PASTE-ACME-PROJECT-ID
X-Api-Key: {{globexMember}}

### A reader can't create: 403
POST {{host}}/projects
X-Api-Key: {{acmeReader}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Not allowed" }

### Enterprise tenant: stored in its own container
POST {{host}}/projects
X-Api-Key: {{initechAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Initech ERP" }
